{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 10622879840522483913,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "SCHED_DEADLINE",
      "source_hash": 13070497295889860515,
      "context_hash": 9965477590142723374,
      "translation": "SCHED_DEADLINE",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292829Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Bandwidth-based real-time scheduling with admission control",
      "source_hash": 3183687871216561248,
      "context_hash": 5189642073093989563,
      "translation": "승인 제어(admission control)를 갖춘 대역폭 기반 실시간 스케줄링",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292830Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What SCHED_DEADLINE provides",
      "source_hash": 9204793222211146824,
      "context_hash": 14353025742135724635,
      "translation": "SCHED_DEADLINE이 제공하는 기능",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292830Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`SCHED_DEADLINE` is the highest-priority regular scheduling policy in Linux (above SCHED_FIFO/RR).",
      "source_hash": 9272598022692636784,
      "context_hash": 12679128448769733077,
      "translation": "`SCHED_DEADLINE`은 Linux에서 우선순위가 가장 높은 일반 스케줄링 정책입니다(SCHED_FIFO/RR보다 높음).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "policy": "정책",
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292830Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Instead of a fixed priority, each task describes its computational requirements:",
      "source_hash": 16477232956313176492,
      "context_hash": 726969175337977693,
      "translation": "각 태스크는 고정 우선순위 대신 자신의 연산 요구 사항을 기술합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292830Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Runtime** (`sched_runtime`): How much CPU time it needs per period",
      "source_hash": 14421198332668363748,
      "context_hash": 13591852807054485951,
      "translation": "**Runtime** (`sched_runtime`): 주기마다 필요한 CPU 시간",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU time": "CPU 시간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292830Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Deadline** (`sched_deadline`): By when it must finish",
      "source_hash": 16473703599398892988,
      "context_hash": 17534291132964260491,
      "translation": "**Deadline** (`sched_deadline`): 완료해야 하는 시한",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292830Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Period** (`sched_period`): How often it repeats (defaults to deadline if unset)",
      "source_hash": 6934913965511236364,
      "context_hash": 8745782434569794003,
      "translation": "**Period** (`sched_period`): 반복 주기(설정하지 않으면 deadline 값이 기본값)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292830Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel enforces these bounds using **Constant Bandwidth Server (CBS)**: each task gets exactly its declared bandwidth and no more.",
      "source_hash": 8595905676257783316,
      "context_hash": 3624714618801002407,
      "translation": "커널은 **Constant Bandwidth Server**(CBS)를 사용해 이러한 한계를 강제합니다: 각 태스크는 선언한 대역폭만큼만 정확히 받으며 그 이상은 받지 못합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "When a task exhausts its runtime budget, it is throttled until the next period.",
      "source_hash": 11707964119185494175,
      "context_hash": 17252482008603769691,
      "translation": "태스크가 runtime 예산을 모두 소진하면 다음 주기까지 스로틀링(throttling)됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Why SCHED_DEADLINE over SCHED_FIFO?",
      "source_hash": 4410010077912382785,
      "context_hash": 11253154925184853611,
      "translation": "SCHED_FIFO 대신 SCHED_DEADLINE을 쓰는 이유",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Property",
      "source_hash": 12663700143509946447,
      "context_hash": 17331229329003241362,
      "translation": "속성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Property": "속성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:32:33.565547Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "SCHED_FIFO",
      "source_hash": 11120508893014205852,
      "context_hash": 2465158644644762421,
      "translation": "SCHED_FIFO",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "SCHED_DEADLINE",
      "source_hash": 13070497295889860515,
      "context_hash": 13324738996398746525,
      "translation": "SCHED_DEADLINE",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Guarantee type",
      "source_hash": 9271147097970291864,
      "context_hash": 12253257473926380195,
      "translation": "보장 유형",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Priority (relative)",
      "source_hash": 5333402913589048975,
      "context_hash": 12141944285550314474,
      "translation": "우선순위(상대적)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Bandwidth (absolute)",
      "source_hash": 11581794615492794219,
      "context_hash": 3769538697887979408,
      "translation": "대역폭(절대적)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Admission control",
      "source_hash": 11884630175746050872,
      "context_hash": 13705840076137424022,
      "translation": "승인 제어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "None",
      "source_hash": 4387124778405518223,
      "context_hash": 7709390817911664868,
      "translation": "없음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Yes — kernel rejects infeasible tasks",
      "source_hash": 13455397382260299041,
      "context_hash": 18110796097612062349,
      "translation": "예 — 커널이 실행 불가능한 태스크를 거부",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Worst-case latency",
      "source_hash": 3470209637542194115,
      "context_hash": 15578782854214395484,
      "translation": "최악의 경우 지연 시간",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "latency": "지연 시간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Unbounded for same-priority tasks",
      "source_hash": 6004274505735376444,
      "context_hash": 14787569663365057316,
      "translation": "같은 우선순위 태스크 간에는 상한 없음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Bounded by deadline",
      "source_hash": 10242152426353909217,
      "context_hash": 9789207179680400541,
      "translation": "deadline으로 상한이 정해짐",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292832Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Overrun behavior",
      "source_hash": 5115042942131115702,
      "context_hash": 16915279008620465099,
      "translation": "초과 실행 시 동작",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292832Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "Starvation",
      "source_hash": 9369869748845703692,
      "context_hash": 4688893107819312247,
      "translation": "기아(starvation)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292832Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Throttled, replenished at next period",
      "source_hash": 15852747573649365466,
      "context_hash": 11640909933272589992,
      "translation": "스로틀링 후 다음 주기에 보충",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292832Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "Use case",
      "source_hash": 4687495918567009598,
      "context_hash": 8996582969669395,
      "translation": "사용 사례",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Use case": "사용 사례"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292832Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "Simple RT tasks",
      "source_hash": 17339052553323708673,
      "context_hash": 4929322687232851743,
      "translation": "단순한 RT 태스크",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RT task": "RT 태스크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292832Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "Periodic tasks with timing requirements",
      "source_hash": 18329736139690508159,
      "context_hash": 17366623239833567870,
      "translation": "타이밍 요구 사항이 있는 주기적 태스크",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292832Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "SCHED_DEADLINE is suitable for tasks with provable timing requirements: video encoding frames, network packet processing at a rate guarantee, industrial control loops.",
      "source_hash": 16569070593007930443,
      "context_hash": 4095958105634866699,
      "translation": "SCHED_DEADLINE은 증명 가능한 타이밍 요구 사항이 있는 태스크에 적합합니다: 비디오 인코딩 프레임, 전송률 보장이 필요한 네트워크 패킷 처리, 산업용 제어 루프 등이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292832Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Data structures",
      "source_hash": 8996165017591287259,
      "context_hash": 14866230532567016509,
      "translation": "자료 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "data structure": "자료 구조"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292832Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "struct sched_dl_entity",
      "source_hash": 18098735174205365808,
      "context_hash": 14437625148767849748,
      "translation": "struct sched_dl_entity",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:51.292832Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Embedded in `task_struct`, tracks per-task deadline state:",
      "source_hash": 12282791619842174284,
      "context_hash": 12258619081254048080,
      "translation": "`task_struct`에 내장되어 태스크별 deadline 상태를 추적합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739523Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "struct dl_rq",
      "source_hash": 9343186660073697650,
      "context_hash": 18382915198996246111,
      "translation": "struct dl_rq",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739524Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Per-CPU deadline runqueue:",
      "source_hash": 15692400141681032340,
      "context_hash": 12982893576948319706,
      "translation": "CPU별 deadline 런큐:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "runqueue": "런큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739525Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Admission control",
      "source_hash": 11884630175746050872,
      "context_hash": 4507780255206041321,
      "translation": "승인 제어(admission control)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739525Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Before a task can become `SCHED_DEADLINE`, the kernel checks whether the system can accommodate it:",
      "source_hash": 7098259309650519472,
      "context_hash": 14623735583327412629,
      "translation": "태스크가 `SCHED_DEADLINE`이 되기 전에 커널은 시스템이 해당 태스크를 수용할 수 있는지 검사합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739526Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The check is global across all CPUs in the scheduling domain.",
      "source_hash": 1325936324425899769,
      "context_hash": 9652155803194874095,
      "translation": "이 검사는 스케줄링 도메인의 모든 CPU에 걸쳐 전역적으로 이루어집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739526Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "If accepting the new task would make the total utilization exceed 100%, `sched_setattr()` returns `-EBUSY`:",
      "source_hash": 8754336531467413358,
      "context_hash": 3454260942495149332,
      "translation": "새 태스크를 받아들였을 때 전체 사용률이 100%를 초과하게 되면 `sched_setattr()`는 `-EBUSY`를 반환합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739526Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "This is unlike SCHED_FIFO/RR where any number of tasks can be created regardless of system capacity.",
      "source_hash": 5107346703151346642,
      "context_hash": 11797330488868355414,
      "translation": "이는 시스템 용량과 관계없이 태스크를 얼마든지 생성할 수 있는 SCHED_FIFO/RR과 다른 점입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739527Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "CBS: budget enforcement and replenishment",
      "source_hash": 868665299333015744,
      "context_hash": 5244282684870354226,
      "translation": "CBS: 예산 강제와 보충",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739527Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Budget exhaustion",
      "source_hash": 14819414575286683199,
      "context_hash": 838328889759283555,
      "translation": "예산 소진",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739527Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Each time the task runs, its remaining `runtime` decreases.",
      "source_hash": 8583010755971969944,
      "context_hash": 13373115270899995534,
      "translation": "태스크가 실행될 때마다 남은 `runtime`이 감소합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739527Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "When it hits zero:",
      "source_hash": 18348313770176253,
      "context_hash": 15510047167203614394,
      "translation": "이 값이 0에 도달하면:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739528Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Task is marked `dl_throttled = 1`",
      "source_hash": 13887217900652804855,
      "context_hash": 4794160224391805706,
      "translation": "태스크가 `dl_throttled = 1`로 표시됨",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739528Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Task is dequeued from the dl_rq",
      "source_hash": 14913134334370109996,
      "context_hash": 8086139270973056918,
      "translation": "태스크가 dl_rq에서 디큐됨",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739528Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "An hrtimer (`dl_timer`) is armed for the next replenishment time",
      "source_hash": 9529011354907539846,
      "context_hash": 9880441246972317786,
      "translation": "다음 보충 시점을 위해 hrtimer(`dl_timer`)가 설정됨",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hrtimer": "hrtimer"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739528Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "The task can no longer run until replenished",
      "source_hash": 2139998035151910422,
      "context_hash": 18092660692423115989,
      "translation": "보충될 때까지 태스크가 더 이상 실행될 수 없음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739528Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Replenishment via dl_task_timer()",
      "source_hash": 15920747742344716536,
      "context_hash": 9184559509135585184,
      "translation": "dl_task_timer()를 통한 보충",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739528Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "`replenish_dl_entity()` sets:",
      "source_hash": 15935534735907603230,
      "context_hash": 16615988697041679397,
      "translation": "`replenish_dl_entity()`는 다음을 설정합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739528Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "`dl_se->runtime = dl_se->dl_runtime` (full budget restored)",
      "source_hash": 4847459697528350916,
      "context_hash": 6212018821144617814,
      "translation": "`dl_se->runtime = dl_se->dl_runtime` (전체 예산 복원)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739529Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "`dl_se->deadline += dl_se->dl_period` (absolute deadline advanced)",
      "source_hash": 17111941436203925030,
      "context_hash": 17673851163426001632,
      "translation": "`dl_se->deadline += dl_se->dl_period` (절대 deadline 전진)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739529Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "EDF selection",
      "source_hash": 8264240837624186160,
      "context_hash": 5952642047913365943,
      "translation": "EDF 선택",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739529Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Among multiple runnable DL tasks, the scheduler always picks the one with the **earliest absolute deadline** (EDF — Earliest Deadline First):",
      "source_hash": 693118103676287741,
      "context_hash": 9062054241769335559,
      "translation": "실행 가능한 DL 태스크가 여러 개 있으면 스케줄러는 항상 **절대 deadline이 가장 이른** 태스크를 선택합니다(EDF — Earliest Deadline First):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739529Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "The RB-tree is ordered by `deadline`, so the leftmost node always has the earliest deadline.",
      "source_hash": 13028335096708207884,
      "context_hash": 11715159997354236411,
      "translation": "RB-tree는 `deadline` 기준으로 정렬되므로 가장 왼쪽 노드가 항상 가장 이른 deadline을 가집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "node": "노드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739530Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "GRUB: reclaiming unused bandwidth",
      "source_hash": 7958277971420860287,
      "context_hash": 16796240191834304565,
      "translation": "GRUB: 사용되지 않은 대역폭 회수",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739530Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A DL task that doesn't use its full budget would waste CPU time — other tasks couldn't use the reserved bandwidth. **GRUB (Greedy Reclamation of Unused Bandwidth)** solves this:",
      "source_hash": 2724777733889199529,
      "context_hash": 6149265070014392825,
      "translation": "예산을 모두 사용하지 않는 DL 태스크는 CPU 시간을 낭비하게 됩니다 — 다른 태스크가 예약된 대역폭을 사용할 수 없기 때문입니다. **GRUB**(Greedy Reclamation of Unused Bandwidth)이 이 문제를 해결합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU time": "CPU 시간",
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739530Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "When a DL task is inactive (sleeping), its unused bandwidth is tracked and made available to other tasks via `extra_bw`.",
      "source_hash": 7510324173483547772,
      "context_hash": 14832607889620312873,
      "translation": "DL 태스크가 비활성(슬립) 상태일 때 사용되지 않은 대역폭이 추적되어 `extra_bw`를 통해 다른 태스크가 사용할 수 있게 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739530Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "This allows the system to run more work than the strict bandwidth reservation would suggest, while still meeting all deadlines when tasks are active.",
      "source_hash": 6983439302515126813,
      "context_hash": 15548350218191820958,
      "translation": "이를 통해 시스템은 엄격한 대역폭 예약이 시사하는 것보다 더 많은 작업을 실행하면서도, 태스크가 활성 상태일 때는 모든 deadline을 여전히 지킬 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739530Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Using SCHED_DEADLINE",
      "source_hash": 17041663375463050738,
      "context_hash": 18004410354210614391,
      "translation": "SCHED_DEADLINE 사용",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739531Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Setting the policy",
      "source_hash": 12707686532003467569,
      "context_hash": 5204439094296718644,
      "translation": "정책 설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "policy": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739531Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Requires `CAP_SYS_NICE`.",
      "source_hash": 3269180967729430593,
      "context_hash": 4928948828104643875,
      "translation": "`CAP_SYS_NICE`가 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739531Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "sched_yield() for SCHED_DEADLINE",
      "source_hash": 14103878694051590794,
      "context_hash": 3142919312098551916,
      "translation": "SCHED_DEADLINE에서의 sched_yield()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:27.739531Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "A DL task should call `sched_yield()` when it finishes its work early.",
      "source_hash": 5456267237711890267,
      "context_hash": 16392034834729802502,
      "translation": "DL 태스크는 작업을 일찍 끝냈을 때 `sched_yield()`를 호출해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:19.033740Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "This tells the CBS that the task is done for this period and the remaining budget can be reclaimed:",
      "source_hash": 12766678190016850677,
      "context_hash": 9722671981874642218,
      "translation": "이렇게 하면 CBS에 태스크가 이번 주기의 작업을 마쳤으며 남은 예산(budget)을 회수할 수 있음을 알립니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:19.033742Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Without `sched_yield()`, the task runs until its budget is exhausted, wasting CPU cycles.",
      "source_hash": 2333344776959590927,
      "context_hash": 13389109605081744873,
      "translation": "`sched_yield()`가 없으면 태스크는 예산이 소진될 때까지 실행되어 CPU 사이클을 낭비합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:19.033743Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Constraints",
      "source_hash": 11930884711566436492,
      "context_hash": 18320531148725588002,
      "translation": "제약 사항",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:19.033744Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "`fork()` from a `SCHED_DEADLINE` task succeeds, but the child is demoted to `SCHED_NORMAL`",
      "source_hash": 11335109960202742951,
      "context_hash": 5320130435629497518,
      "translation": "`SCHED_DEADLINE` 태스크에서 호출한 `fork()`는 성공하지만, 자식은 `SCHED_NORMAL`로 강등됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:19.033744Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "`pthread_create()` in a DL task works, but the new thread inherits `SCHED_NORMAL`",
      "source_hash": 9514500602454719595,
      "context_hash": 2088330350704108449,
      "translation": "DL 태스크에서 `pthread_create()`는 동작하지만, 새 스레드는 `SCHED_NORMAL`을 상속합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:19.033745Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "DL tasks cannot be part of a cgroup with CPU limits",
      "source_hash": 16456324399603465098,
      "context_hash": 12746144349422018348,
      "translation": "DL 태스크는 CPU 제한이 설정된 cgroup에 속할 수 없습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "cgroup": "cgroup"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:19.033745Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Interaction with RT tasks",
      "source_hash": 8249088000904158799,
      "context_hash": 4718121302821538670,
      "translation": "RT 태스크와의 상호작용",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RT task": "RT 태스크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:19.033746Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`dl_sched_class` sits above `rt_sched_class` in the class hierarchy.",
      "source_hash": 7514167279277575578,
      "context_hash": 7514786473655713693,
      "translation": "클래스 계층 구조에서 `dl_sched_class`는 `rt_sched_class`보다 위에 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:19.033746Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "A SCHED_DEADLINE task always preempts SCHED_FIFO/RR tasks, regardless of RT priority.",
      "source_hash": 15980695867423135190,
      "context_hash": 8163647761636601966,
      "translation": "SCHED_DEADLINE 태스크는 RT 우선순위와 관계없이 항상 SCHED_FIFO/RR 태스크를 선점합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:19.033747Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "If an RT task holds a mutex that a DL task needs, priority inheritance boosts the RT task's priority.",
      "source_hash": 8914759893945624863,
      "context_hash": 12827635913732709667,
      "translation": "DL 태스크가 필요로 하는 뮤텍스를 RT 태스크가 보유하고 있으면, 우선순위 상속(priority inheritance)이 RT 태스크의 우선순위를 높입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RT task": "RT 태스크",
        "mutex": "뮤텍스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:19.033747Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "SCHED_DEADLINE also has boosting support via `is_dl_boosted()` — when a DL task is boosted, its effective deadline is derived from the donor task.",
      "source_hash": 356659605342820385,
      "context_hash": 12347415795871105530,
      "translation": "SCHED_DEADLINE도 `is_dl_boosted()`를 통한 부스팅을 지원합니다 — DL 태스크가 부스팅되면 유효 데드라인은 도너(donor) 태스크로부터 도출됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:19.033748Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
